[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     36[0m:[38;5;10m[49m verification pass (integration suite plus ad-hoc sweeps) was roughly 30,000
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     37[0m:[38;5;10m[49m distinct inputs, covering:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     38[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
