[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     41[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   across them)
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     42[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * single well-formed item, plus trailing junk after the item
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     43[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * all decimal grammar edges: `.5`, `5.`, `.`, `-.`, `..`, `1.2.3`, leading zeros
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     44[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * exponent edges: `1e`, `1e+`, `1e-x`, `1.e5`, `e5`, `1e 5`
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     45[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * signs, including `--1`, `+ 1`, bare `-`, bare `+`, and signed zero
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     46[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * `inf` / `infinity` in every case mix, plus every prefix of `infinity`
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     47[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * `nan`, `nan()`, `nan(payload)`, unterminated `nan(abc`
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     48[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * hex floats: `0x1p3`, `0x.8p1`, `0x8.p1`, `0x1p` with no exponent digits,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     49[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `0xg`, and both no-digit forms `0x` and `0x.`
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     50[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * overflow to `inf`, underflow to `0`, the whole subnormal range, and
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     51[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   round-to-nearest-even ties at the 24-bit boundary
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     52[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * exponents far outside `int` range in both the decimal and hex forms
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     53[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * tokens up to 200,000 characters and 500,000 bytes of leading whitespace
